Subject: [PATCH 00872/11362] [outer-loop] FINAL base: openbmb/MiniCPM5-1B
 (recent, apache-2.0, Llama-arch, no trust_remote_code)

Operator suggestion, verified: MiniCPM5-1B is apache-2.0, 2026-05-26 (current), trainable
safetensors (~2-3GB), standard LlamaForCausalLM (no trust_remote_code), 1B (fast FT on a
3090, headroom on hard math). Resolves both prior issues (Qwen3.6 no small variant; 27B
QLoRA heavy). A credible recent headline base in its own right; Qwen3.6-27B QLoRA stays
the optional scale-up. Supersedes the Qwen3.5/Qwen3.6 base notes.

